            470,
            252
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)若 $x(t) = e^{-4t}u(t)$ ， $y(0^{+}) = \\frac{1}{3}, y'(0^{+}) = \\frac{1}{3}$ ，求2系统的输出 $y(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
